1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ole Christensen lived and ran the farm Søndre Greaker during his marriage to Johanne. It is most likely that it is during his time that the main building was raised on the farm in 1831. This building is still in us
2 CONC e as of 1999.                                                                      In 1861, the place Aslakhytten, was divided from 235a Nordre Greaker and from 245b Søndre Greaker and given matr.no. 245B1 (later gnr. 160.3).     
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT After Ole Christensen died in 1865, the farm Søndre Greaker was taken over by Ole's widow Johanne Andersdatter. Ole and Johanne got 11 children, 5 sons and 6 daughters.
