1 NAME Anna Sofie Pinaas (Johannesdatter Dintorp)
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 28 SEP 1887
2 ADDR
3 CITY Nokkerud, Degernes
3 STAE Østfold
3 CTRY Norway
