1 NOTE {geni:about_me} About: http://pinaas.no/slekt/dingtorp.htm 
2 CONT
2 CONT About his mother and the family histori (in Norwegian with sources): http://www.pinaas.no/slekt/Maren%20Oline%20Hansdatter%20og%20noen%20av%20hennes%20etterkommere-artikkel-o.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian died as an infant shortly after he was born. He was buried together with his mother, but not registered on the tomb stone. He was never called Dingtorp because he died while his family still lived at Aasen. His father mo
2 CONC ved to Dingtorp after both Christian/Kristian and his mother had died. 
