1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mari was married to Svennung Sørensen Lilleheier in Degernes. She was his second wife. When she died without leaving children (they had 2 children but they died as infants), her mother and all her siblings became t
2 CONC he widower's heirs. In a letter, dated September 18, 1777, we first find the name of Mari's mother Berthe Alfsdatter, now married to Anders Jørgensen, living at Store Watvedt (ie, actually at Watvedt-Ødegaard). Mari had 9 siblings
2 CONC  who were: Hans, Ole, Iver, Marthe, Else, Anne, Anne J., Ahlet and Johanne. 
