3 STAE Ø
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 18 APR 1909
2 ADDR
3 CITY Degernes kirke
3 STAE Østfold
3 CTRY Norway
1 BURI
2 DATE MAY 1966
2 ADDR
3 CITY Degernes kirke
3 STAE Østfold
